cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these artifacts, please cite the KSE 2026 paper."
title: "LexRoute — EduLawQA artifacts: trajectories, benchmarks, and evaluation harness"
abstract: >-
  1,342 citation-validated agentic trajectories over Vietnamese education law,
  two evaluation benchmarks (EduLawQA-Route and EduLawQA-MultiSource), the
  filtering and judging prompts, and the evaluation harness accompanying
  "Trajectory Distillation for Faithful Statutory Citations in Vietnamese
  Education Law QA".
